e/CVE-2026-8732","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-8732","https://www.wordfence.com/threat-intel/vulnerabilities/wordpress-plugins/wp-maps-pro/cve-2026-8732/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0072","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0072.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-32998","title":"Veeam Service Provider Console 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Veeam Service Provider Console 存在参数处理不当漏洞（CWE-233），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 VSPC Web 端口（默认 12800）发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Veeam Service Provider Console 9.2.1.33875 之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重。厂商已发布 KB4853 安全更新，建议立即升级至 9.2.1.33875 或更新版本，同时禁用 Alarm Script Execution 功能并限制管理端口访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-32998"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-28T05:16:35.970","updated":"2026-06-17T10:36:43.867","remediation":"立即升级 Veeam Service Provider Console 至 9.2.1.33875 及以上版本（对应 KB4853）；在 VSPC 管理界面中禁用 Alarm Script Execution 功能；在防火墙上限制 VSPC Web 端口（12800）仅允许内部管理网段访问，禁止暴露于公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.veeam.com/kb4853","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32998.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-05-28/TIER_2_CVE-2026-32998.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a72c2d0c49169a0d402485a1b08b9cdd8f9a4630/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32998.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-32998.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-32998","https://github.com/Gatos90/security-llm-wiki/blob/c8d27f1e6ab2ce6bff111d2104bb306d7ef1bcb5/advisories/cve/CVE-2026-32998.md","https://github.com/github